                        "form": "die Windpocken"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                        "entry_id": "2c846975-640d-3666-b602-e3e63a03b3c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "die Varizellen; durch Tröpfchen- und Schmierinfektion übertragene Viruserkrankung mit juckendem Exanthem und Fieber"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "529c9dfc-9b55-4f0e-adf1-a12724ba140f",
                                "sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                                "text": "Unser Sohn liegt mit Windpocken im Bett."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40de845f-7463-4c24-b319-61d2e4171263",
                                "sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                                "text": "„Nur, mit ihrem eigenen Glauben daran schien es nicht gar so weit her zu sein, denn sie bekamen Masern, Keuchhusten und Windpocken.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5856cd22-16b5-4bdc-9e40-7cf84cf694a8",
                                "sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                                "text": "Müdigkeit, Pusteln, starke Hals- und Kopfschmerzen – und hohe Ansteckungsgefahr: Wenn Erwachsene an Windpocken erkranken, verläuft die Kinderkrankheit häufig sehr schwer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d740b669-1cdf-4bc5-b363-540fd8b37aa4",
                                "sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                                "text": "Tuberkulose ist aber nicht so hochansteckend wie beispielsweise virale Erkrankungen: Masern, Windpocken, Ebola."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b24f7e48-3be2-32f5-9c3a-cca6618e4151",
                        "entry_id": "2c846975-640d-3666-b602-e3e63a03b3c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sich bei dieser Krankheit bildendes Bläschen auf der Haut"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f76a0cf8-b091-4636-80dc-0e468e5528aa",
                                "sense_id": "b24f7e48-3be2-32f5-9c3a-cca6618e4151",
                                "text": "Der Pickel sieht aus wie eine Windpocke."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d406a1cb-ede1-4018-ad04-23c38b73e9a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "2c846975-640d-3666-b602-e3e63a03b3c6",
                        "source_sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                        "target_lang_word": "chicken pox",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chicken pox",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9f2852b-8b81-3194-a9f6-b639fb10e4a7",
                                        "entry_id": "a72881f5-722e-324a-a960-423036788d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The blisters formed by the varicella zoster virus (VZV)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d64cdd8-8df3-397c-97df-74fda0cd5c0e",
                                        "entry_id": "a72881f5-722e-324a-a960-423036788d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The highly contagious airborne disease caused by initial infection with varicella zoster virus, typically causing a skin rash that forms small itchy blisters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0cfb6b0-5bc8-4d6d-9f83-ec7eba9e8c7b",
                                                "sense_id": "4d64cdd8-8df3-397c-97df-74fda0cd5c0e",
                                                "text": "Chickenpox parties, at which children gather so they can all be infected by a child who has the pox, are often held by parents who distrust chickenpox vaccine or want their children to have the stronger immunity that surviving a full-blown infection affords."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aec3c8b-3ad5-3fe0-a046-377bf383f503",
                                        "entry_id": "a72881f5-722e-324a-a960-423036788d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any disease causing similar symptoms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c0b660e-e5c8-4913-a0ec-3a4de254a3b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "2c846975-640d-3666-b602-e3e63a03b3c6",
                        "source_sense_id": "672445b2-d235-30ce-ab5c-0a335cc87554",
                        "target_lang_word": "varicelle",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "varicelle",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "002d74e9-e1f3-38ec-86c3-695e7c516dcf",
                                        "entry_id": "eee5fc01-e155-3493-b2fa-b7d7be0a95d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Maladie infectieuse et contagieuse, qui affecte particulièrement les enfants et qui est caractérisée par une éruption de petites vésicules."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Nosologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "554a9611-bf28-48a5-a54c-cfde9a395cf3",
                                                "sense_id": "002d74e9-e1f3-38ec-86c3-695e7c516dcf",
                                                "text": "Moderna travaille sur des vaccins contre d’autres virus tels que le virus d’Epstein-Barr, les herpès, la varicelle et les norovirus responsables de la gastro-entérite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be6ea9dc-04a9-4bab-aeea-d4caf16ec754",
                                                "sense_id": "002d74e9-e1f3-38ec-86c3-695e7c516dcf",
                                                "text": "« Tant qu’on reste dans les rhinos, les gastros, les angines, les bronchiolites, la varicelle, le pied-main-bouche, etc., il ne faut pas s’inquiéter. Par contre, si c’est plus intense que la normale, il faut peut-être aller voir du côté de l’immunité », conseille Brigitte Virey, présidente du Syndicat national des pédiatres français."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
